[I] X Fixes Library

[T] libXfixes is the client library for the XFIXES extension, which provides
[T] fixes and additions to the core X protocol such as region objects,
[T] cursor change notification and selection tracking.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxfixes

